{"sections":[{"slug":"数学对象的表现","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"数学对象的表现"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">数学对象的表现</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"数学对象的表现"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一种数学对象的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">表现</span></strong> (presentation), <span lang=\"zh\">又称</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">模型</span></strong> (model), <span lang=\"zh\">是指由较少量</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">简单</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">具体</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">容易计算的信息给出一些由抽象方法定义的结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这些表现常常脱离对象的实质</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有时也不同于专家们思考这些对象的方式</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">通常被表现的那种抽象的结构在理论上更对称</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">更优雅</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">选取适当的表现</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是为了在破坏了对称和优雅的代价之下</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">使这些对象更便于计算</span>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯百科","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯百科</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">十分重视表现和实质的区分</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">经常明确指出某些结构不过是人们真正关心的另一些对象的表现</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">代数结构如群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">模等可用一组</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">生成元</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">和</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">关系</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一个流形的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">坐标卡</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是这个流形的一种表现</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">选取适当的坐标卡是为了简化流形上的函数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">微分形式等对象的计算</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">同伦型</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">可以表现</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模型范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是一类具有良好性质的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的表现</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}